<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Data rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Data rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Jim Marks initiated coverage of First Data Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.31 per share for 1996.</p>
<p>-- shares rose one to 37-3/4.  </p>
<p>-- set a 12-month target price of $46 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects the company to continue to benefit from the increasing usage of credit and ebit cards.</p>
<p>-- said the company is &quot;perfectly situated&quot; to take advantage of emerging opportunities in online commerce and payments.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
